		(at 9.6 119.72)
		(descr "MEIHUA MHT151RGBCT reverse-mount 1206 RGB LED (common anode). Pattern per datasheet 'Recommended Solder Pad (Reverse Type)': hole D2.1, four 0.8x0.7 pads at (+-1.55, +-0.55), drawn as seen from the solder side. Same geometry as marbastlib LED_MX_1206R (made for this part). Pad numbers follow KiCad Device:LED_ARGB (1=A, 2=RK, 3=GK, 4=BK); the LED's own pins are 1=+, 2=B, 3=G, 4=R, so LED pin 2 sits on pad 4 and LED pin 4 on pad 2. Place at the MX LED position (0, -5.08) relative to the switch, on the bottom layer, light goes up through the hole.")
